="margin-left:44px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:5px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="#3-1-6-background-jobs-bullmq" style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:none;">3.1.6  Background Jobs (BullMQ)</a></div><div style="margin-left:44px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:5px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="#3-1-7-file-storage" style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:none;">3.1.7  File Storage</a></div><div style="margin-left:22px;font-size:10.5pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:5px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="#3-2-core-domain-modules" style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:none;">3.2  Core Domain Modules</a></div><div style="margin-left:44px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:5px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="#authentication" style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:none;">Authentication</a></div><div style="margin-left:44px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:5px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="#driver" style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:none;">Driver</a></div><div style="margin-left:44px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:5px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="#rider" style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:none;">Rider</a></div><div style="margin-left:44px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:5px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="#admin-dashboard" style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:none;">Admin Dashboard</a></div><div style="margin-left:44px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:5px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="#ride" style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:none;">Ride</a></div><div style="margin-left:44px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:5px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="#matching-engine" style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:none;">Matching Engine</a></div><div style="margin-left:44px;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;margin-bot